<title>USA: V Band names Thomas Hughes president.</title>
<headline>V Band names Thomas Hughes president.</headline>
<dateline>ELSMFORD, N.Y. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>V Band Corp said Wednesday that chief operating officer Thomas Hughes has been named president.</p>
<p>Hughes, who started with V Band in 1988, has served as vice president of marketing and a manager of engineering, among other positions, the maker of telephone systems said. Clients include the Montreal Exchange, the New York Mercantile Exchange and the Sydney Futures Exchange, the company said.</p>
